      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m just noticing that these OC inputs are currently configured as open-drain outputs but are supposed to be inputs.\n\nAnd A4 is unconnected if not present, so if not too hard I think we should make this pin unused by default and enable it as an input if USB4 is present so it\u0027s not left as a floating input.",
      "revId": "3183cd6749b6ab273b3155bfc71d183eaf6633f9",
